Klik Deploy, berikan izin akses (Authorize access) jika diminta.
Salin Web App URL yang dihasilkan (contoh format URL: [https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycb.../exec](https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycb.../exec)).
